// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3808621470" "Now that we have gained a true understanding of the eldritch horror that is the Circle of Thorns, it has become a matter of great import that we learn the full history of the war between the Oranbegans and the people of Mu. To this end, I have devised a cunning plan: We have learned that one of the Circle's librarians is present in the isles, no doubt to plunder the proud legacy of the Mu. We know that the usurped bodies the members of the Circle inhabit are as vehicles to them, but I believe that they still feel all agonies inflicted on them. Thus, it may be possible to pry some information from this Librarian. I charge you with this task: <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Capture the Librarian and learn what you can from him, by any means neccessary!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3361972830" "Capture the Circle Librarian and learn what you can from him"
// SendOffString :
"P2883573736" "The guard upon this Librarian will likely not be strong. Strike swiftly and catch him. And after you've learned what you can, I don't care what befalls the mortal shell he now controls."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P295747959" "Capture Circle Librarian"

