"P2818022728" "A history of the war, written by an Oranbegan traitor? I would be intrigued even if obtaining a copy did not involve causing humiliation and grief to the Legacy Chain and Longbow. I must have this history! And you, you shall help me attain it."
// RandomFameString :
"P1995834500" "I heard {VillainName} is working with Mu'Drakhan again. Some people have more ambition than sense."

