// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3949487354" "I have thrown wide the net of my resources, and have gathered a valuable catch of information. There is a representative of the Legacy Chain who is even now working with Longbow. They plan to transfer over a series of books under heavy guard, so that the Legacy Chain may use them. As far as I can tell, the books are not in themselves magical, and are rumored to have originally been hand-written. I beleive that these may well be the written history of the Oranbegan war you learned about from the Circle Librarian. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want to know when and where the books are due to arrive, and I would task you to find out by capturing this representative of the Legacy Chain.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2106193145" "Kidnap Legacy representative"
// SendOffString :
"P1129841162" "The Legacy Chain themselves are so far beneath your power that I doubt the representative will be able to fight you. His Longbow guardians, on the other hand, will likely be most adamant in preventing your escape."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1021058393" "Longbow is able to operate in the open in these parts of the Isles, acting as beacons of hope to the oppressed people of other Islands. Hopes you will soon crush."

