// Dialog :
"P70152721" "The Legacy Chain mystic keeps to his story. It seems that Aurora Borealis herself will be bringing a copy of Akarist's history to the Isles. I must have those books, but this is a dangerous complication. I would strongly suggest gathering a number of assosciates if you haven't already. You may need the assistance, because I will not be deterred in getting those books."
// RandomFameString :
"P866285659" "I heard {VillainName} broke into a Longbow compound and kidnapped some mystic guy right out from under their noses!"

