// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3900884720" "The history of the war between the ancestors of Mu and the hated Oranbegans is even now being delivered into the hands of the enemies of Arachnos. I will have it, and you shall get it for me. But this will not be easy. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The heroine Aurora Borealis travels with them, no doubt watching over them psychically as well as physically. You are to steal those books, and defeat Aurora Borealis so that we can break her psychic watch over them.</A> Be warned that there is a limited amount of time for this. If the books are not in our possession and Aurora defeated with 2 hours, they may be able to recall them back to Paragon City using their teleport network."
// AcceptString :
"P4252662316" "Defeat Aurora Borealis and take the books within 2 hours"
// SendOffString :
"P699886182" "You must defeat Aurora Borealis and take the books. One without the other will allow Paragon City's vigilanties to recover the books before we can examine them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3871880805" "Defeat Aurora & get books"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1350154665" "This is the right place and time. Now, you just have to defeat one of the most powerful psychics in the world and steal the books she was set to guard within 2 hours."

